     6	Reason: Structural decomposition of Paperclip for selective adoption into VECTORFL User Surface.
     7	
     8	## 1. Taxonomic Objects of Paperclip
     9	
    10	### A. The "Inbox" Object (Axis of Triage)
    11	- **DNA**: `Centralized Inbound Management`.
    12	- **Structural Setting**:
    13	  - `ui/src/pages/Inbox.tsx`: Aggregates `approvals`, `issues`, `alerts`, and `failed_runs`.
    14	  - Uses `InboxCategoryFilter` to switch between different types of "Pending Work".
    15	- **Meaning**: The UI is a "Command Center" where raw requests are turned into actionable tickets.
    16	
